<title>BELGIUM: BMT buys Croatian glass moulds company.</title>
<headline>BMT buys Croatian glass moulds company.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian metals group BMT NV said on Wednesday it had signed an agreement in principle to buy at least 77 percent of Croatian glass moulds company Straza Alatnica.</p>
<p>The deal was retroactive from January 1, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>It said that Straza Alatnica, a profitable independent company, had a 1996 turnover of 134 million Belgian francs and a workforce of 120.</p>
<p>BMT gave no financial details.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
